# Stop reason numbers of ivs_run_report.stop_reason (plan 04-08, D-04): NAME VALUE.
# Append-only: never renumber, never reuse. The set equals the IVS_STOP_* defines of
# core/include/ivs/*.h (generic define pin of tools/check/api-effects.cmake). 0 is not a stop
# reason (a refused call does not write stop_reason).
IVS_STOP_TARGET 1
IVS_STOP_CPU_HALTED 2
IVS_STOP_GUEST_FAULT 3
IVS_STOP_INTERNAL 4
IVS_STOP_FRAME 5
